  "limitations": [
    "Five recordings from 2026-09-20 to 2026-09-22, not the September 23 clips previously used for threshold selection.",
    "Eight visually labelled known-item operations cover five items and only two catalog sound groups; two drags and six rapid transfers are reported separately.",
    "Labels were selected from pictures before inspecting those positive predictions. Hidden trader identities are never inferred from recognizer output.",
    "Audio is a mixed AAC recording decoded by timestamp to mono PCM24k. There are no uncovered samples. It is not a live game-process capture test.",
    "The replay is synchronous with no busy worker, foreground gating, live mouse hooks, UI publishing, or history deduplication. Counts are analysis outputs, not visible popup counts.",
    "Temporal association uses onset -0.20 s to +0.35 s, choosing by time rather than score. No nearby onset is not proof that every overlapping audio window was empty.",
    "Hidden trader labels confirm ten visible drags in one 40-second excerpt, not all merchant operations in all recordings. Very short unobserved actions may be absent.",
    "Accepted-output reviews are post-prediction picture checks. Thirteen hidden-goods outputs remain unverifiable; no overall precision or whole-match accuracy is estimated.",
